
CLAUDE.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-box config. The repo is run in place, so this is how local decisions
# (coordinates, app choices) survive a git pull. server.py prefers it over
# server/config.json when it exists.
server/config.local.json

# ee3 daemon credentials (EE3_USERNAME / EE3_PASSWORD). Lives on the LXC, not
# the Pi, and must never end up in the repo — movieapi.py reads it via
# EE3_ENV_FILE.
server/ee3.env
*.tsv.tmp
